      <p source="#source-388-435"><seg source="#source-388-400">みよわが</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-400-415"><rb>賽</rb><rt>さい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-415-435">は空にあり、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-435-452"><seg source="#source-435-452">空は透青、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-452-535"><seg source="#source-452-461">白鳥は</seg><hi rend="bouten 傍点 right" source="#source-461-509" corresp="#source-473-509"><seg source="#source-461-473">こてえぢ</seg></hi><seg source="#source-509-535">のまどべに泳ぎ、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-535-552"><seg source="#source-535-552">卓は一列、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-552-586"><seg source="#source-552-586">同志の瞳は愛にもゆ。</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-586-621"><seg source="#source-586-621">みよわが賽は空にあり、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-621-638"><seg source="#source-621-638">賽は純銀、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-638-718"><hi rend="bouten 傍点 right" source="#source-638-680" corresp="#source-647-680"><seg source="#source-638-647">はあと</seg></hi>の「Ａ」は指にはじかれ、</p>
      <p source="#source-718-738"><seg source="#source-718-738">緑卓のうへ、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-738-772"><seg source="#source-738-772">同志の瞳は愛にもゆ。</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-772-807"><seg source="#source-772-807">みよわが光は空にあり、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-807-824"><seg source="#source-807-824">空は白金、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-824-868"><seg source="#source-824-868">ふきあげのみづちりこぼれて、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-868-897"><seg source="#source-868-897">わが賽は魚となり、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-897-937"><seg source="#source-897-937">卓上の手はみどりをくむ。</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-937-987"><seg source="#source-937-987">ああいまも想をこらすわれのうへ、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-987-1049"><seg source="#source-987-993">また</seg><hi rend="bouten 傍点 right" source="#source-993-1035" corresp="#source-1002-1035"><seg source="#source-993-1002">えれな</seg></hi><seg source="#source-1035-1049">のうへ、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-1049-1075"><seg source="#source-1049-1075">愛は祈祷となり、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-1075-1107"><seg source="#source-1075-1107">賭博は風にながれて、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-1107-1163"><seg source="#source-1107-1163">さかづきはみ空に高く鳴りもわたれり。</seg></p>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-1163-1211" style="padding-inline-start: 12em">
        <p source="#source-1187-1211"><seg source="#source-1187-1211">―八月三十一日―</seg></p>
      </div>
    </body>
